# Listed component codes by squared norm, and the surviving code pairs

`e7CodeNormBuckets` splits the 5,253 listed packed component codes by squared
norm; bucket `h` holds the codes of squared norm `2 * h`.

`e7CandidateCodePairs` lists the 421 norm-complementary pairs of listed codes
that pass both the eligibility filter and the trace filter.  Of these,
`e7RefutedCodePairs` holds the 378 refuted by the scalar target equations and
`e7TraceCodePairs` the 43 that survive; the surviving pairs are exactly the
component keys of listed centroid profile pairs.
